The database
------------
The tables in this repository, taken together as a database, are made available
under the Open Database License (ODbL) v1.0:
https://opendatacommons.org/licenses/odbl/1-0/

Any rights in individual contents of the database are licensed under the
Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0 International licence (CC BY-SA 4.0):
https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/

The full texts of both licences are in LICENSES/ODbL-1.0.txt and
LICENSES/CC-BY-SA-4.0.txt.

What this does not cover
------------------------
1. Quotations of third-party pages that are not openly licensed - government
   sites, news outlets, other websites, and the text of FOTW Flags Of The World
   (https://www.crwflags.com/fotw/flags/disclaim.html) - are included as
   quotation, each with its source named beside it. They are not licensed by
   us; reuse them only as quotation, and FOTW's text only for non-commercial,
   non-political purposes, unaltered.
2. Values and quotations from other datasets keep their own terms, which the
   README lists with the attribution each requires. Data from OpenStreetMap
   (via Overture Maps) is (c) OpenStreetMap contributors, under the ODbL.
3. No boundary data is included. Codes of GADM units (GID_1) appear as keys
   only; GADM's data is not redistributed here.
4. The flags, emblems, maps and recordings the deck uses are not in this
   repository and keep their own terms, named in each note's `source`.
